 Has 8 to 12 years of experience in accounting analysis, FP&A or financial analysis;
 Has an advanced level of English proficiency , as the role involves communicating with English-speaking partners on a regular basis.
 Has a very advanced level of French proficiency , as the team is French-speaking and the majority of the work is conducted in French.
